---
import StudioLayout from '../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
---
<StudioLayout title="Classification of Elements - Chemistry with Harshith" chapterChip="Class 11 · Chemistry">
  <section class="screen active">
    <div class="scr-head">
      <a class="back-btn" href="/chemistry" style="text-decoration:none;">‹ Back</a>
      <div>
        <div class="scr-title">Classification of <span style="color:var(--nine-accent);">Elements</span></div>
        <div class="scr-sub">Two topics - how the table was built, and the trends that govern atomic size.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <a class="tile" href="/periodic-classification" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
        <div class="tile-num">01</div>
        <div class="tile-icon ic-build">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Periodic <span class="accent">Classification</span></h3>
        <p>Triads, octaves, Mendeleev to Moseley - trace how the periodic table was built, then explore blocks, groups and IUPAC names.</p>
        <span class="tile-go">9 activities - Open ›</span>
      </a>

      <a class="tile" href="/chemistry/effective-nuclear-charge" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
        <div class="tile-num">02</div>
        <div class="tile-icon ic-grid">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5"/><ellipse cx="12" cy="12" rx="10" ry="4.5"/><ellipse cx="12" cy="12" rx="10" ry="4.5" transform="rotate(60 12 12)"/><ellipse cx="12" cy="12" rx="10" ry="4.5" transform="rotate(120 12 12)"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Effective Nuclear Charge &amp; <span class="accent">Atomic Size</span></h3>
        <p>Z<sub>eff</sub>, shielding and Slater's rules, the types of atomic radius, and how atomic & ionic size vary across periods and groups.</p>
        <span class="tile-go">7 activities - Open ›</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</StudioLayout>
